# Islandwalk (CR 702.14c) stops blocks only "as long as defending player controls an Island": Bot2 controls a Forest and
# no Island, so its Llanowar Elves may block Bot1's Cenote Scout, which Lord of Atlantis made a 2/2 with islandwalk. The
# Scout kills the 1/1 Elves and survives the 1 damage it takes; the unblocked Lord deals 2: Bot2 goes to 18. The positive
# control of lord-of-atlantis-pumps-other-merfolk-and-gives-them-islandwalk-against-an-island, where an Island stops the
# same block.

